#
# This repository is intentionally public-facing only.
# Track README.md and showcase media folders, while keeping the private
# application source, secrets, configs, virtualenvs, node_modules, and runtime
# data out of Git.

*

!README.md
!.gitignore
!Images/
!Images/**
!Videos/
!Videos/**

# Keep platform metadata out even inside allowed folders.
.DS_Store
Images/.DS_Store
Videos/.DS_Store
